# pkgsrc

This is historical pkgsrc guidance and has not been verified against current
pkgsrc package catalogs or supported platforms. Check your pkgsrc tree for a
maintained freeDiameter package before relying on old package names or paths.

For a source build, install the dependencies listed in `INSTALL` using the
packages available for your host, then use the portable CMake procedure there.
Optional extensions may need MySQL or PostgreSQL client development files,
libxml2, Python 3 development files, SWIG, jsoncpp, JSON Schema, or PCRE++,
depending on which extensions you enable.
